  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span>The Uttar Pradesh Board of Revenue (UP BOR) provides an online facility to search and verify Income, Caste, and Domicile Certificates issued in Uttar Pradesh. Using the UP Document/Certificate Verification Portal, individuals can check the validity of certificates and documents required for different government services, helping to ensure their authenticity. This system enables applicants to determine whether their documents are genuine or fake.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Board of Revenue (UP BOR)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Caste, Niwas, Income Certificate Online Verification 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>Already Start</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>Not Available</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">There is no application fee required for registration, checking, or verification of Caste, Income, and Domicile Certificates. Simply visit the provided link and enter your Praman Patra Number to check the status.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Which Certificate Verify </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Income Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Domicile Certificate</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Process for Search Old Certificate</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Enter Your Certificate 11 digit Code and Check the Status Link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Enter the Certificate No. to Search Status of Certificate. </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Process for Search New Certificate</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Search Your New Certificate / E District Verification (12 Digit Code)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Click On the New Certificate Link. and after that fill in 12 digit code and then verify that’s original.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Benefits of Online Certificate Verification</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Verifying UP Income, Caste, and Domicile Certificates is essential to ensure that benefits and reservation facilities reach only eligible applicants. This process helps curb false or fraudulent claims and safeguards the rights of deserving individuals by ensuring they receive their legitimate entitlements.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Online Certificate Verification Process</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"289\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Once the certificate is issued, the applicant is required to upload it on the official website of the Uttar Pradesh Revenue Department for verification. The online portal allows candidates to submit the necessary details and upload relevant documents as part of the verification process.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"480\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The portal also includes a tracking facility through which applicants can check the status of their verification by entering their application number, date of birth, and the captcha code.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"767\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">If the certificate is found to be genuine and valid, a verification certificate is issued, which must be produced during admission or recruitment to claim related benefits or reservations. However, if the certificate is found to be fake or invalid, the applicant may face legal action</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Documents Required for UP Caste, Income Certificate Online Apply </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhaar Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ration Card (optional)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Voter ID / PAN Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Recent Passport Size Photo</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Caste Proof (family or relative’s old caste certificate)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Self-declaration form (download from portal)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Domicile Certificate of UP</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Income Certificate (for OBC creamy layer)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Check Certificate Online</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates have to open the official website of bor.up.nic.in</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on BOR UP Certificate Verification Online 2026 Board of Revenue</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And you will see All links for the Check All Certificate.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Click on Any Certificate.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Enter your 11 or 12 Digit Certificate Code.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">That’s Done.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UP Income | Caste | Domicile Certificate Verification 2026 Last Date is NA</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Income Certificate</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://edistrict.up.gov.in/edistrictup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Domicile Certificate</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://edistrict.up.gov.in/edistrictup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Caste Certificate</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://edistrict.up.gov.in/edistrictup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcel